# Only what the image is built from goes to the builder: the packages, the
# page, the scripts, the project files, and the changelog's entries, which
# wiki-server embeds (through its link wiki-server/changelog). Not the build directories or
# node_modules (the builder makes its own), and not .git, docs/ or anything
# else in the working tree, a cabal.project.local included.
*
!cabal.project
!cabal-native-opt.project
!cabal-wasm.project
!cabal-wasm-opt.project
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!toolchain/
!web/
!wiki-core/
!wiki-api/
!wiki-app/
!wiki-server/
!changelog/
**/dist-newstyle
**/node_modules
**/.ghc.environment.*
